# Lahza — front-end env vars (all optional for dev; required items noted)

# ---- AI / moderation -------------------------------------------------------
# Route AI generation + image moderation server-side.
# REQUIRED before public launch: when set, image moderation is enforced and
# the endpoint is called for content review before checkout. When unset, the
# app uses built-in deterministic templates and skips image moderation
# (acceptable in dev/staging; not acceptable in production).
VITE_AI_ENDPOINT=

# ---- Analytics -------------------------------------------------------------
# VITE_GA_ID=G-XXXXXXXXXX

# ---- Payment / WhatsApp / secrets ------------------------------------------
# API keys and secrets belong server-side, not in VITE_ vars (browser-visible).
# See README for the recommended UAE payment stack (Telr / PayTabs / Tabby / Tamara).
